request.description:
FAILURE EXAMPLE: Objection without a reason.

The reason field is defined with min_length=1 in ObjectionCreate schema. An empty string fails Pydantic validation before reaching the service layer.

Expected result: 422 Unprocessable Entity with a validation error body:
{
  "detail": [
    {
      "type": "string_too_short",
      "loc": ["body", "reason"],
      "msg": "String should have at least 1 character",
      ...
    }
  ]
}

This demonstrates that objections without a stated reason are rejected at the schema level, not the service level.

